  "temper": {
    "$comment": "Tempering (docs/game-theory/DESIGN_TEMPERING_2026-11-08.md, IMPLEMENTATION_NOTE_TEMPERING.md). From unlockKeep, the owner sets each tempered building type to a profile in steps of 1/steps on three axes (sum <= steps); every building of the type carries it. Per axis at full weight f = points/steps: range adds, splashRadius sets, fireSlow lengthens the fire interval, damageCost is subtracted from damage additively across axes (damage x (1 - sum damageCost x f)). preferFarAt: from this Reach share the tower prefers attackers fighting from prefersBeyond tiles (the Longbow Yagura rule). baseWide axes act on other buildings by the base profile (the mean f over all tempered buildings). Re-tempering a type costs retemperCostShare of the cumulative Coins of its buildings. Calibrated in the real sim (2026-11-09): each pure profile moves a ten-army panel's mean destruction by at most 4.2 points at Keeps 12 and 15 (power-neutral), while Reach cuts ranged lines, Blast swarms and Eclipse, and Watch air (docs/game-theory/TEMPERING_CALIBRATION_2026-11-09.md).",
